.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH rev-stealth-auth 1  "rev-stealth-auth " 
.SH NAME
rev\-stealth\-auth \- Authenticated session capture / lifecycle (Phase 9d). Subcommands: login / list / show / delete / status / refresh
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBrev\-stealth auth\fR [\fB\-\-output\-format\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Authenticated session lifecycle (Phase 9d). Login captures cookies via rev\-auth and stores them sealed under AuthStore; list/show emit redacted metadata; status reports freshness; refresh re\-runs login; delete shreds the profile.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-output\-format\fR \fI<OUTPUT_FORMAT>\fR
Output format for this subcommand: `human` (default) or `json`. Shadows the global `\-\-format` for this invocation. Same value enum as the global flag; the JSON output is documented under `docs/json\-schemas/cli/<subcommand>.output.json`
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
human
.IP \(bu 2
json
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
rev\-stealth\-auth\-login(1)
Spawn `rev\-auth` for interactive login; AUP\-gated
.TP
rev\-stealth\-auth\-list(1)
List saved profiles (metadata only, cookie values never disclosed)
.TP
rev\-stealth\-auth\-show(1)
Show a single profile\*(Aqs metadata (redacted)
.TP
rev\-stealth\-auth\-delete(1)
Delete a profile with shred\-on\-delete
.TP
rev\-stealth\-auth\-status(1)
Report freshness/expiry status for a profile
.TP
rev\-stealth\-auth\-refresh(1)
Re\-run interactive login, overwriting an existing profile
.SH EXTRA
EXAMPLES:
  $ rev\-stealth auth login \-\-profile work \-\-url https://x.test
  $ rev\-stealth auth list
  $ rev\-stealth auth status \-\-profile work
  $ rev\-stealth auth delete \-\-profile work \-\-force

EXIT CODES:
  0  Ok               Action completed.
  1  UserError        Bad args / unknown profile / AUP rejection.
  3  PermanentError   AuthStore unavailable / rev\-auth not installed.
  4  AuthExpired      Profile expired or unusable (login/status/refresh paths).

ENV:
  REV_OBSCURA_BIN              Override the obscura binary path.
  REV_AUTH_BIN                 Override the rev\-auth helper binary.
  REV_SCRAPING_AUTH_DIR        Override the AuthStore directory.
  REV_SCRAPING_AUTH_PASSPHRASE Sealed\-store passphrase (else keystore\-derived).
  REV_SCRAPING_REQUIRE_VPN     When `1`, enforces VPN\-required guard.
